. * ------------------------------
. * 1. Mata 辅助函数
. * ------------------------------
. mata:
------------------------------------------------- mata (type end to exit) -----
: real matrix row_normalize(real matrix W)
> {
>     real scalar i, s
>     real matrix R
> 
>     R = W
>     for (i = 1; i <= rows(R); i++) {
>         s = sum(R[i,])
>         if (s != 0) {
>             R[i,] = R[i,] :/ s
>         }
>     }
>     return(R)
> }

: end
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

